{
  "slug": "perxel-blocks",
  "name": "Perxel Blocks",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Scaffold, audit and manage custom ACF Gutenberg blocks for WordPress with Tailwind CSS integration. Tested with NectarBlocks.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `audit-blocks` (Fast structural audit of all blocks — checks required files, wrapper attributes, fields.json timestamp, preview.png), `audit-blocks-deep` (Deep AI audit of all blocks — runs structural checks first, then uses AI to review content quality,…), `create-block` (Scaffold a new ACF Gutenberg block with block.json, fields.json, and render.php), `init` (Initialize a new WordPress theme with the wp-blocks-dev block development workflow)\n- **Agents** (1): `wp-blocks-dev` (WordPress block development agent with full wp-blocks-dev architecture context)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install perxel-blocks@claude-community` from `perxel/perxel-blocks`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1
  },
